{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.QGenericBaseReal","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.QGenericBaseReal","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.QGenericBase","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.SpecialFunctions.Pow.Real"],"declarations":1,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.isQGeneric_real","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.isQGeneric_real","kind":"theorem","line":27,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AlgebraicSubstrate/QGenericBaseReal.lean#L27-L40","doc":"**The archimedean instance.** Every real `q > 1` is `q`-generic — the\nsubstrate anchor `q₀ ≈ 1.10998` included.\n\n`ℝ` here is not a §7c violation but the point of the exercise: this is the\nspecialisation past the archimedean wall, and it genuinely needs the ordering\n(`cyclotomic_pos'` holds because every root of `Φ_d` lies on the unit circle, so\n`Φ_d` cannot vanish to the right of `1`).\n\nIt also settles non-vacuity where it matters. The class is not merely\ninhabitable by some toy ring; it is satisfied at the value the framework actually\nevaluates at, so a definition stated over `IsQGeneric` reaches the substrate. ","signatureChunk":0}]}